{"seq":2,"slug":"ebpf-program-types","title":"eBPF 程序类型详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-program-types","wordCount":1680,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ebpf-程序类型详解\">eBPF 程序类型详解</h1><p>eBPF 的程序类型（program type）决定了程序能挂载到哪个 hook 点、能访问什么样的上下文数据、能调用哪些 helper 函数。截至 Linux 6.x 内核，已定义超过 30 种程序类型。对于可观测性工程师，需要深入掌握的核心类型约 10 种——它们覆盖了网络追踪、系统分析、安全监控的全部需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>程序类型是 eBPF 能力边界的划分依据——同一个 verifier、同一套 helper 机制，按程序类型被授予不同的 hook 点、上下文结构与可用 helper 集合。对可观测性工程师而言，选型的本质是回答三个问题：要观测的对象是网络包、内核函数、安全决策还是 CPU 事件；该对象是否有稳定的追踪接口（tracepoint）；以及对性能的敏感度能承受多大的单次开销。这三个问题分别决定了用哪一族程序类型、用静态还是动态挂载、以及在 kprobe 与 fentry 之间如何取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"程序类型分类体系\">程序类型分类体系</h2><p>eBPF 程序类型可按应用领域分为四大族群。每个族群内的类型共享相似的上下文结构和 helper 函数集合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[eBPF 程序类型] --&gt; B[网络族]&#10;    A --&gt; C[追踪族]&#10;    A --&gt; D[安全族]&#10;    A --&gt; E[其他]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[XDP]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[tc/cls_act]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[socket filter]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[sk_msg/sk_skb]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[kprobe/kretprobe]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[tracepoint]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[perf_event]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[fentry/fexit]&#10;    C --&gt; C5[raw_tracepoint]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[LSM]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[cgroup/sock]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[struct_ops]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[iter]\">flowchart TD\n    A[eBPF 程序类型] --&gt; B[网络族]\n    A --&gt; C[追踪族]\n    A --&gt; D[安全族]\n    A --&gt; E[其他]\n    B --&gt; B1[XDP]\n    B --&gt; B2[tc/cls_act]\n    B --&gt; B3[socket filter]\n    B --&gt; B4[sk_msg/sk_skb]\n    C --&gt; C1[kprobe/kretprobe]\n    C --&gt; C2[tracepoint]\n    C --&gt; C3[perf_event]\n    C --&gt; C4[fentry/fexit]\n    C --&gt; C5[raw_tracepoint]\n    D --&gt; D1[LSM]\n    D --&gt; D2[cgroup/sock]\n    E --&gt; E1[struct_ops]\n    E --&gt; E2[iter]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>族群</th>\n<th>核心特征</th>\n<th>上下文类型</th>\n<th>可观测性价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络族</td>\n<td>操作数据包，可修改/丢弃/重定向</td>\n<td><code>xdp_md</code>, <code>__sk_buff</code></td>\n<td>流量分析、协议解析、连接追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪族</td>\n<td>只读观测内核事件，不影响执行流</td>\n<td><code>pt_regs</code>, <code>trace_event_raw_*</code></td>\n<td>延迟分析、调用链追踪、性能剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全族</td>\n<td>可做安全决策（允许/拒绝）</td>\n<td>LSM hook 参数</td>\n<td>运行时策略执行、异常检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化操作</td>\n<td>替换内核子系统的回调实现</td>\n<td>子系统特定结构</td>\n<td>TCP 拥塞控制、调度器定制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kprobe-与-kretprobe-动态内核追踪\">kprobe 与 kretprobe：动态内核追踪</h2><p>kprobe 是最灵活的追踪类型——可以挂载到内核中几乎任何函数的入口或返回点。它通过在目标地址插入断点指令（<code>int3</code> on x86）实现拦截，触发时将 CPU 寄存器状态作为上下文传递给 eBPF 程序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// kprobe 上下文：CPU 寄存器快照&#10;SEC(&quot;kprobe/tcp_connect&quot;)&#10;int BPF_KPROBE(trace_tcp_connect, struct sock *sk)&#10;{&#10;    // sk 是 tcp_connect 的第一个参数&#10;    // 通过 BPF_CORE_READ 安全读取内核结构体字段&#10;    u16 dport = BPF_CORE_READ(sk, __sk_common.skc_dport);&#10;    u32 daddr = BPF_CORE_READ(sk, __sk_common.skc_daddr);&#10;    // 记录到 map...&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// kprobe 上下文：CPU 寄存器快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kprobe/tcp_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_KPROBE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trace_tcp_connect, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // sk 是 tcp_connect 的第一个参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 通过 BPF_CORE_READ 安全读取内核结构体字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u16 dport </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_CORE_READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sk, __sk_common.skc_dport);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 daddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_CORE_READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sk, __sk_common.skc_daddr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 记录到 map...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：覆盖内核全部导出函数（数万个），无需内核预定义追踪点。</p>\n<p><strong>劣势</strong>：不是稳定 ABI——内核函数签名和内部结构可能在版本间变化；断点机制有约 50-100ns 的额外延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：深入追踪特定内核子系统行为、访问 tracepoint 未覆盖的函数、短期调试与根因分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fentry-fexit-btf-感知的高性能追踪\">fentry/fexit：BTF 感知的高性能追踪</h2><p>fentry/fexit 是 Linux 5.5+ 引入的新型追踪机制，替代 kprobe 用于需要长期运行的可观测性场景。它利用 BTF 类型信息直接访问函数参数，无需手动解析寄存器；利用 ftrace trampolines 替代断点指令，开销降低约 5-10 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// fentry 直接获得类型化参数，无需 PT_REGS 解析&#10;SEC(&quot;fentry/tcp_connect&quot;)&#10;int BPF_PROG(fentry_tcp_connect, struct sock *sk)&#10;{&#10;    // 直接使用 sk，编译器已知其类型&#10;    u16 dport = BPF_CORE_READ(sk, __sk_common.skc_dport);&#10;    return 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// fexit 同时获得参数和返回值&#10;SEC(&quot;fexit/tcp_connect&quot;)&#10;int BPF_PROG(fexit_tcp_connect, struct sock *sk, int ret)&#10;{&#10;    if (ret != 0) {&#10;        // 连接失败，记录错误&#10;    }&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// fentry 直接获得类型化参数，无需 PT_REGS 解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fentry/tcp_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_PROG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fentry_tcp_connect, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 直接使用 sk，编译器已知其类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u16 dport </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_CORE_READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sk, __sk_common.skc_dport);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// fexit 同时获得参数和返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fexit/tcp_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_PROG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fexit_tcp_connect, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> ret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 连接失败，记录错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>kprobe</th>\n<th>fentry/fexit</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内核版本要求</td>\n<td>4.1+</td>\n<td>5.5+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>挂载机制</td>\n<td>int3 断点</td>\n<td>ftrace trampoline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数访问</td>\n<td>手动解析 PT_REGS</td>\n<td>BTF 自动类型化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次开销</td>\n<td>~80-150ns</td>\n<td>~10-30ns</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值访问</td>\n<td>需单独 kretprobe</td>\n<td>fexit 原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套支持</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tracepoint-稳定的内核追踪接口\">tracepoint：稳定的内核追踪接口</h2><p>tracepoint 是内核开发者在代码中显式定义的追踪点，具有稳定的 ABI 保证。每个 tracepoint 有明确的参数格式定义（在 <code>/sys/kernel/debug/tracing/events/</code> 下可查看）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// tracepoint 上下文是预定义的结构体&#10;SEC(&quot;tracepoint/syscalls/sys_enter_openat&quot;)&#10;int trace_openat(struct trace_event_raw_sys_enter *ctx)&#10;{&#10;    // ctx-&gt;args[0] = dfd, args[1] = filename, args[2] = flags&#10;    char *filename = (char *)ctx-&gt;args[1];&#10;    char buf[256];&#10;    bpf_probe_read_user_str(buf, sizeof(buf), filename);&#10;    // 记录文件打开事件...&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tracepoint 上下文是预定义的结构体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tracepoint/syscalls/sys_enter_openat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trace_openat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_event_raw_sys_enter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ctx->args[0] = dfd, args[1] = filename, args[2] = flags</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)ctx->args[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    bpf_probe_read_user_str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf), filename);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 记录文件打开事件...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Linux 内核提供了约 2000+ 个 tracepoint，覆盖核心子系统：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子系统</th>\n<th>典型 tracepoint</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统调用</td>\n<td><code>syscalls/sys_enter_*</code></td>\n<td>系统调用审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度器</td>\n<td><code>sched/sched_switch</code></td>\n<td>上下文切换分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td><code>net/net_dev_xmit</code></td>\n<td>数据包发送追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>块设备</td>\n<td><code>block/block_rq_complete</code></td>\n<td>IO 延迟分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td><code>kmem/mm_page_alloc</code></td>\n<td>内存分配追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td><code>ext4/ext4_da_write_begin</code></td>\n<td>文件写入追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"xdp-最早期的数据包处理\">XDP：最早期的数据包处理</h2><p>XDP（eXpress Data Path）程序在网卡驱动收包后、进入内核网络协议栈之前执行。这是 Linux 网络栈中最早的可编程点，适合需要线速处理的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"SEC(&quot;xdp&quot;)&#10;int xdp_filter(struct xdp_md *ctx)&#10;{&#10;    void *data = (void *)(long)ctx-&gt;data;&#10;    void *data_end = (void *)(long)ctx-&gt;data_end;&#10;&#10;    struct ethhdr *eth = data;&#10;    if ((void *)(eth + 1) &gt; data_end)&#10;        return XDP_PASS;&#10;&#10;    if (eth-&gt;h_proto == htons(ETH_P_IP)) {&#10;        struct iphdr *ip = (void *)(eth + 1);&#10;        if ((void *)(ip + 1) &gt; data_end)&#10;            return XDP_PASS;&#10;        // 统计 IP 流量...&#10;    }&#10;    return XDP_PASS;  // 放行数据包&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"xdp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xdp_filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xdp_md </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)ctx->data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)ctx->data_end;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ethhdr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(eth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> XDP_PASS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (eth->h_proto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> htons</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ETH_P_IP)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iphdr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(eth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(ip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> XDP_PASS;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 统计 IP 流量...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> XDP_PASS;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 放行数据包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>XDP 程序的返回值决定数据包命运：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>XDP_PASS</code>：继续进入协议栈正常处理</li>\n<li><code>XDP_DROP</code>：在驱动层丢弃，不分配 <code>skb</code></li>\n<li><code>XDP_TX</code>：从同一网卡发回</li>\n<li><code>XDP_REDIRECT</code>：重定向到其他网卡或 CPU</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tc-traffic-control-协议栈内的数据包处理\">tc（Traffic Control）：协议栈内的数据包处理</h2><p>tc 程序挂载在网络栈的 ingress/egress 路径，在 XDP 之后、socket 层之前执行。它能访问完整的 <code>sk_buff</code> 结构，支持修改数据包内容、添加/删除头部。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"SEC(&quot;tc&quot;)&#10;int tc_ingress(struct __sk_buff *skb)&#10;{&#10;    void *data = (void *)(long)skb-&gt;data;&#10;    void *data_end = (void *)(long)skb-&gt;data_end;&#10;&#10;    // 可以访问 skb 的丰富元数据&#10;    __u32 ifindex = skb-&gt;ifindex;&#10;    __u32 mark = skb-&gt;mark;&#10;&#10;    // 协议解析与流量统计...&#10;    return TC_ACT_OK;  // 放行&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tc_ingress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> __sk_buff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">skb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)skb->data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)skb->data_end;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 可以访问 skb 的丰富元数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    __u32 ifindex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> skb->ifindex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    __u32 mark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> skb->mark;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 协议解析与流量统计...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TC_ACT_OK;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 放行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>XDP</th>\n<th>tc</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行位置</td>\n<td>网卡驱动层（协议栈前）</td>\n<td>协议栈内（ingress/egress）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文结构</td>\n<td><code>xdp_md</code>（精简）</td>\n<td><code>__sk_buff</code>（丰富）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可访问信息</td>\n<td>原始数据包字节</td>\n<td>数据包 + socket/路由元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改能力</td>\n<td>有限（无 skb 分配）</td>\n<td>完整（可 encap/decap）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>最高（无内存分配）</td>\n<td>高（已有 skb）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>DDoS 过滤、负载均衡</td>\n<td>策略执行、流量可视化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"perf_event-cpu-性能分析\">perf_event：CPU 性能分析</h2><p>perf_event 类型的 eBPF 程序挂载到 CPU 硬件性能计数器（PMU）或软件事件上，在采样频率触发时执行。这是构建 CPU 火焰图、cache 命中率分析等性能工具的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"SEC(&quot;perf_event&quot;)&#10;int profile(struct bpf_perf_event_data *ctx)&#10;{&#10;    // 获取当前进程信息&#10;    u64 id = bpf_get_current_pid_tgid();&#10;    u32 pid = id &gt;&gt; 32;&#10;&#10;    // 采集内核态调用栈&#10;    struct stack_key key = { .pid = pid };&#10;    key.kern_stack_id = bpf_get_stackid(ctx, &amp;stack_map, 0);&#10;    key.user_stack_id = bpf_get_stackid(ctx, &amp;stack_map,&#10;                                         BPF_F_USER_STACK);&#10;&#10;    // 计数器递增&#10;    u64 *count = bpf_map_lookup_elem(&amp;counts, &amp;key);&#10;    if (count)&#10;        __sync_fetch_and_add(count, 1);&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"perf_event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bpf_perf_event_data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 获取当前进程信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_current_pid_tgid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32 pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 采集内核态调用栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack_key key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { .pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    key.kern_stack_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_stackid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stack_map, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    key.user_stack_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_stackid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stack_map,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                         BPF_F_USER_STACK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 计数器递增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u64 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_map_lookup_elem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counts, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        __sync_fetch_and_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lsm-安全策略执行\">LSM：安全策略执行</h2><p>LSM（Linux Security Module）类型的 eBPF 程序（Linux 5.7+）挂载到内核安全决策点，可以做出允许或拒绝的判断。这是 Tetragon 和 eBPF-based Falco 的技术基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"SEC(&quot;lsm/file_open&quot;)&#10;int BPF_PROG(restrict_file_open, struct file *file, int ret)&#10;{&#10;    // 如果前序 LSM 已拒绝，直接传递&#10;    if (ret != 0)&#10;        return ret;&#10;&#10;    // 检查是否访问敏感路径&#10;    const char *path = BPF_CORE_READ(file, f_path.dentry,&#10;                                      d_name.name);&#10;    // 匹配策略并决策...&#10;    return 0;  // 0 = 允许，负值 = 拒绝&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lsm/file_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_PROG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(restrict_file_open, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> ret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果前序 LSM 已拒绝，直接传递</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ret;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查是否访问敏感路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BPF_CORE_READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file, f_path.dentry,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                      d_name.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 匹配策略并决策...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 0 = 允许，负值 = 拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"程序类型选择决策树\">程序类型选择决策树</h2><p>面对具体的可观测性需求时，按以下逻辑选择程序类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{观测目标是什么?} --&gt; B[网络数据包]&#10;    A --&gt; C[内核函数行为]&#10;    A --&gt; D[安全事件]&#10;    A --&gt; E[CPU/性能指标]&#10;    B --&gt; B1{需要线速处理?}&#10;    B1 --&gt;|是| B2[XDP]&#10;    B1 --&gt;|否| B3[tc 或 socket filter]&#10;    C --&gt; C1{有对应 tracepoint?}&#10;    C1 --&gt;|是| C2[tracepoint]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|否| C3{内核 5.5+ 且有 BTF?}&#10;    C3 --&gt;|是| C4[fentry/fexit]&#10;    C3 --&gt;|否| C5[kprobe]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[LSM]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[perf_event]\">flowchart TD\n    A{观测目标是什么?} --&gt; B[网络数据包]\n    A --&gt; C[内核函数行为]\n    A --&gt; D[安全事件]\n    A --&gt; E[CPU/性能指标]\n    B --&gt; B1{需要线速处理?}\n    B1 --&gt;|是| B2[XDP]\n    B1 --&gt;|否| B3[tc 或 socket filter]\n    C --&gt; C1{有对应 tracepoint?}\n    C1 --&gt;|是| C2[tracepoint]\n    C1 --&gt;|否| C3{内核 5.5+ 且有 BTF?}\n    C3 --&gt;|是| C4[fentry/fexit]\n    C3 --&gt;|否| C5[kprobe]\n    D --&gt; D1[LSM]\n    E --&gt; E1[perf_event]</pre><p><strong>实践建议</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>优先使用 tracepoint——稳定 ABI，跨版本兼容</li>\n<li>需要追踪 tracepoint 未覆盖的函数时，优先 fentry/fexit，其次 kprobe</li>\n<li>网络可观测性首选 tc（信息最丰富），性能极端敏感时用 XDP</li>\n<li>安全策略执行必须用 LSM 类型（可做阻断决策）</li>\n<li>CPU 火焰图用 perf_event + stack unwinding</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>程序类型的选择直接决定了可观测性方案的能力上限与稳定性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>首选类型</th>\n<th>关键理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稳定追踪内核子系统</td>\n<td>tracepoint</td>\n<td>稳定 ABI，跨版本兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪 tracepoint 未覆盖的函数</td>\n<td>fentry/fexit</td>\n<td>基于 BTF，开销为 kprobe 的 1/5 左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络线速处理</td>\n<td>XDP</td>\n<td>协议栈前执行，无 skb 分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络深度可视化</td>\n<td>tc</td>\n<td>可访问完整 sk_buff 与元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全策略阻断</td>\n<td>LSM</td>\n<td>唯一能做允许/拒绝决策的类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 性能剖析</td>\n<td>perf_event</td>\n<td>采样驱动，支撑火焰图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型优先级：先看是否有稳定 tracepoint，再考虑 fentry/fexit，最后才退回 kprobe；网络场景在线速与信息丰富度之间权衡 XDP 与 tc。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"ebpf-architecture\">eBPF 架构与执行模型</a> 提供程序加载、验证和执行的底层机制；<a href=\"ebpf-maps-helpers\">eBPF Map 与 Helper 函数</a> 详解各程序类型可使用的数据结构和内核 API。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"eBPF 程序类型详解","id":"ebpf-程序类型详解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"程序类型分类体系","id":"程序类型分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"kprobe 与 kretprobe：动态内核追踪","id":"kprobe-与-kretprobe-动态内核追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"fentry/fexit：BTF 感知的高性能追踪","id":"fentry-fexit-btf-感知的高性能追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"tracepoint：稳定的内核追踪接口","id":"tracepoint-稳定的内核追踪接口"},{"level":2,"text":"XDP：最早期的数据包处理","id":"xdp-最早期的数据包处理"},{"level":2,"text":"tc（Traffic Control）：协议栈内的数据包处理","id":"tc-traffic-control-协议栈内的数据包处理"},{"level":2,"text":"perf_event：CPU 性能分析","id":"perf_event-cpu-性能分析"},{"level":2,"text":"LSM：安全策略执行","id":"lsm-安全策略执行"},{"level":2,"text":"程序类型选择决策树","id":"程序类型选择决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"eBPF 架构与执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-architecture"},"next":{"title":"eBPF Map 与 Helper 函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-maps-helpers"}}